<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6500 per</p>
<p>dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after</p>
<p>75.5000 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 4		  June 3</p>
<p> High			     75.7000		 75.7000</p>
<p> Low				75.4100		 75.3000</p>
<p> Open			     75.4100		 75.7000</p>
<p> Close			    75.6500		 75.5000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     1.835		   4.280</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
